name is Mr. Game!\\rMy heart pounds with excitement when\\npeople enjoy my Coin game!\\rIn fact, that’s what I live for!\\nYou look like quite a challenger!\\rWhy don’t you play my Coin game?\\fYou can get fabulous prizes if you\\nmanage to collect a lot of Coins. {YESNO 0}","msg_0511_T07SP0101_00001":"","msg_0511_T07SP0101_00002":"","msg_0511_T07SP0101_00003":"All right!\\nHere is your Coin Case!\\r","msg_0511_T07SP0101_00004":"Show me how you play and make\\nmy heart pound with excitement!\\r","msg_0511_T07SP0101_00005":"Playing my Coin game will make your\\nheart and my heart both pound with\\fexcitement, you know?","msg_0511_T07SP0101_00006":"My name is Mr. Game!\\rMy heart pounds with excitement when\\npeople enjoy my Coin game!\\rIn fact, that’s what I live for!\\nGo ahead and play it!\\fMake my heart pound with excitement!","msg_0511_T07SP0101_00007":"Go ahead and play my Coin game!\\nMake my heart pound with excitement!","msg_0511_T07SP0101_00008":"What a feeling!\\nNothing beats Coin-game spectatorship!\\rOh! I almost forgot!\\rYou can go to the building next door\\nand exchange your Coins for prizes.","msg_0511_T07SP0101_00009":"Did you come back to play\\nmy Coin game?","msg_0511_T07SP0101_00010":"It seems you need a Coin Case\\nto play...\\r","msg_0511_T07SP0101_00011":"Mr. Game: Aha!\\nYou must be here to play my Coin game!\\rCome here and I’ll give you a Coin Case!","msg_0511_T07SP0101_00012":"Mr. Game: Show me how you play and\\nmake my heart pound with excitement!\\r","msg_0511_T07SP0101_00013":"Mr. Game: Huh?\\rWhy don’t you sit across from me\\nand show me how you play?","msg_0511_T07SP0101_00014":"Yo, legend in the making!\\nDo you play this Coin game, too?\\rI’ve been trying for the prize Pokémon,\\nbut that’s a tough game to beat!"},"initTriggers":[],"initScripts":{},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_T07SP0101_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_T07SP0101_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_T07SP0101_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_T07SP0101_003":3,"obj_T07SP0101_suit":0,"obj_T07SP0101_sunglasses